// a whole number of terminal cells, so the Image box shows it unstretched.
//
// Inputs (all strings): kind = "math" | "typst"; src = the source file's path
// (under --root); cw, ch = one cell's width and height in pt (1 pt = 1 css px
// of the terminal); maxw = the most width the picture may use, in pt;
